# Theme files

Full map: `src/theme/README.md`.

- Export key in `src/theme/index.ts` is the `useComponentProps` name and the `app.config.ui` key. Filename is kebab-case of that key.
- No Vue, no DOM. `button.ts` is a function of `options`; `card.ts` / `app.ts` are static slot objects.
- Slot keys must match `data-slot` in the Vue file.
- Write complete class strings (`bg-primary`, `text-error`). Palette names (`blue`, `slate`) belong in `app.config.ui.colors` only.
- Use semantic tokens (`text-default`, `bg-elevated`) and logical directions (`ms`/`me`, `text-start`).
- Spacing utilities use the Figma step, not Tailwind's 4px grid. `p-8` is 16px. `p-4` is 8px. Do not use fractional steps (`1.5`, `2.5`).
- Radius and border-width utilities use the Figma name. `rounded-sm` is 8px. `rounded-md` is 12px. `border-xs` is 1px. `border-sm` is 2px.
- Figma type roles use the `typo-` prefix. `typo-label-large` sets size, line-height, weight, tracking, and family. Single properties are `typo-size-label-large`, `typo-leading-label-large`, `typo-weight-label-large`, `typo-tracking-label-large`, and `typo-family-brand`. Tailwind `text-sm` and `font-medium` stay separate.
- Gate `transition-colors` on `options.theme.transitions`.
- Add the same key to `AppConfigUI` in `src/templates.ts`.
